# Git must not rewrite line endings anywhere in this repository.
#
# scripts/package-eithost.ps1 copies LICENSE, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and
# packaging/README.zh-CN.md into the delivery directory verbatim and records
# SHA256SUMS.txt over the resulting bytes. With end-of-line conversion enabled,
# a clone materialises different bytes than the ones those checksums were
# computed from, so the published package fails its own verification and
# unmodified files report as changed.
* -text
